{# <twig:c975LCard:BackChoice choice="{{ choice }}" name="..." chooseUrl="..." [currency="USD"]><twig:c975LCard:Back .../></twig:c975LCard:BackChoice> - one back to choose from, inside a <div class="card-back-choices" data-controller="basket">: the site's own drawing of it given in the tag. "choice" holds "slug", "held", "chosen" and, not held, "forSale", "price" (in cents) and "id". Chosen it says so; held, a tap posts "back" and "_token" (the CSRF token "submit") to "chooseUrl"; not held it is greyed and padlocked, seen large in a dialog and bought from its price, there or beside "see", in "currency" or else the shop's own #}
{% props choice, name, chooseUrl, currency = null %}
{% set drawn %}{% block content %}{% endblock %}{% endset %}
{% set price = (choice.forSale ?? false) ? (choice.price / 100)|format_currency(currency ?: config('shop-currency') ?: 'EUR') : null %}
<div class="card-back-choice{{ choice.chosen ? ' is-chosen' }}{{ choice.held ? '' : ' is-locked' }}">
	<div class="card-back-choice__preview">{{ drawn }}</div>
	<span class="card-back-choice__name">{{ name }}</span>
	{% if choice.chosen %}
		<span class="card-back-choice__state">{{ 'label.back_chosen'|trans({}, 'card') }}</span>
	{% elseif choice.held %}
		{# The button laid over the whole back, a button holding no block of its own #}
		<form method="post" action="{{ chooseUrl }}">
			<input type="hidden" name="back" value="{{ choice.slug }}">
			<input type="hidden" name="_token" data-controller="csrf-protection" value="{{ csrf_token('submit') }}">
			<button type="submit" class="card-back-choice__pick" aria-label="{{ 'label.back_choose'|trans({'%name%': name}, 'card') }}"></button>
		</form>
	{% else %}
		<div class="card-back-choice__actions">
			<button type="button" class="btn btn-small" commandfor="back-{{ choice.slug }}" command="show-modal">{{ 'label.back_see'|trans({}, 'card') }}</button>
			{% if price %}
				{{ include('@c975LCard/components/_back_buy.html.twig', {'choice': choice, 'name': name, 'price': price, 'text': price}) }}
			{% endif %}
		</div>
		<twig:c975LUi:Dialog:Dialog id="back-{{ choice.slug }}" title="{{ name }}">
			<div class="card-back-choice__large">{{ drawn }}</div>
			{% if price %}
				{{ include('@c975LCard/components/_back_buy.html.twig', {'choice': choice, 'name': name, 'price': price, 'text': 'label.back_buy_for'|trans({'%price%': price}, 'card'), 'dialog': 'back-' ~ choice.slug}) }}
			{% endif %}
		</twig:c975LUi:Dialog:Dialog>
	{% endif %}
</div>
